note groups: every group with how many tours it holds, nested by indentation. The agent reaches for it to see how the map is organised, and which group a new tour belongs in, without listing every tour (commit 10dc7e690b8b). A group has no existence of its own: it is the set of tours that name it, so the list is derived from the tours' groups each time and an empty group cannot be listed.

